ts":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."},{"id":"single-vocabulary-owner","statement":"The critical partition set is read from CRITICAL_SYSTEM_PARTITION_IDS (system-partition-classification.js), the required replica count from getInitialReplicaIds (system-table-schemas-constants.js), the voter test from isVoterRaftRole (raft/replica-voter-readiness.js), and the service type from SERVICE_TYPE. The evaluator re-derives none of them locally and hardcodes no replication factor or role list."},{"id":"distinct-voting-node-is-the-invariant","statement":"Convergence for a critical partition is the count of DISTINCT node IDs each holding an active, quorum-voting partition replica of THAT partition, and must be >= the required replica count. Three replicas on one node is not converged; learners and non-partition services are not eligible capacity; rows for another partition never contribute."},{"id":"ambient-hardened","statement":"The answer is invariant under ambient mutation of Array, Object, Set and String prototypes, including Set.prototype.forEach and Set.prototype.values: Sets are drained through a captured iterator and every row field is read through an own-property descriptor."},{"id":"projection-only-no-second-authority","statement":"The evaluator is a pure projection over supplied rows: it mints no readiness verdict, no lifecycle transition and no cluster-ACTIVE or READY answer, and nothing derives ACTIVE or READY from nodes.status, publication counts, or coverage."},{"id":"fail-closed-typed","statement":"Absent, empty or unreadable placement evidence is NOT converged, with a typed reason; absence is never treated as satisfaction and is never skipped."},{"id":"runtime-unchanged","statement":"No existing readiness, barrier, routing or lifecycle behaviour changes in this Quest; nothing yet consumes the evaluator; system-table creation keeps its seed-local initial representation; ratchet baselines are not raised."},{"id":"mutation-discriminating","statement":"Every guard the evaluator relies on has a receipt that reds when that guard is removed: partition_id, voter role, service type, and the captured Set iterator were each verified by mutation to flip exactly one receipt red. A receipt that cannot fail is not evidence."},{"id":"independent-control","statement":"classification-vocabulary-unchanged lives in a test file that does NOT import the evaluator, so it stays green when the evaluator is absent and reds only on real vocabulary drift."}],"verificationTemplates":[],"landingRequirements":null,"frontierIds":["critical-system-placement-distinct-node-invariant-v3-main"]}}
